@participant1 Yes, I'm using the proprietary APIs. Not sure if the issue would be reproducible on your Env or not.
As I see from the issues on Gradio github repo, others are also facing the same issue.
I've included most of the code.

@participant1 Issue was with one of the lib dependencies [httpx](https://github.com/encode/httpx).
httpx lib has a default [`timeout=5.0 seconds`](https://github.com/encode/httpx/blob/master/httpx/_config.py#L367). ==> this was causing the timeout issue for Gradio, which was showing Error on the Gradio front-end.

Thought to share it here. It'd be useful for others.
